## 一、工具清单与安装

### 1.1 Kali 默认自带（开箱即用）

```
nmap  whatweb  sqlmap  ffuf  gobuster  dirb  wafw00f  feroxbuster
john  hashcat  proxychains4  burpsuite(Community)  seclists
dnsutils  netcat  socat  hydra  medusa
```

`amass` 在较新版本里被移出默认安装，`which amass` 没有就单独装。

### 1.2 需要自己装

Go 系：`subfinder` `httpx` `katana` `dnsx` `interactsh-client` `gau` `assetfinder` `waybackurls` `anew` `dalfox` `puredns` `fscan` `chisel`

其他：`dirsearch`（pip）`xsstrike`（pip）`neoreg`（Python）`linpeas`/`winPEAS`（下载脚本）`jq`（apt）

### 1.3 安装

**方式 A：GitHub Release 的 .deb 包（最稳，推荐）**

不编译、不配 PATH、自动装到 `/usr/bin`。

```bash
wget https://github.com/projectdiscovery/subfinder/releases/latest/download/subfinder_2.x.x_linux_amd64.deb
sudo dpkg -i subfinder_*.deb
```

**方式 B：go install**

```bash
go version                      # 确认 go1.21+
echo 'export PATH=$PATH:$HOME/go/bin' >> ~/.zshrc && source ~/.zshrc

go install -v github.com/projectdiscovery/subfinder/v2/cmd/subfinder@latest
go install -v github.com/projectdiscovery/httpx/cmd/httpx@latest
go install -v github.com/projectdiscovery/katana/cmd/katana@latest
go install -v github.com/projectdiscovery/dnsx/cmd/dnsx@latest
go install -v github.com/projectdiscovery/interactsh/cmd/interactsh-client@latest
go install -v github.com/lc/gau/v2/cmd/gau@latest
go install -v github.com/tomnomnom/assetfinder@latest
go install -v github.com/tomnomnom/waybackurls@latest
go install -v github.com/tomnomnom/anew@latest
go install -v github.com/hahwul/dalfox/v2@latest
go install -v github.com/d3mondev/puredns/v2@latest
go install -v github.com/shadow1ng/fscan@latest
go install -v github.com/jpillora/chisel@latest
```

> 坑：不配 PATH 的话，装完一律 `command not found`。

**方式 C：Python 类（新版 Kali 有 PEP 668 限制）**

```bash
sudo apt install -y pipx jq
pipx install dirsearch && pipx install xsstrike && pipx ensurepath
# 直接 pip install 会报 externally-managed-environment
```

**其他**

```bash
sudo apt install -y nmap whatweb sqlmap ffuf gobuster dirb wafw00f feroxbuster seclists golang-go pipx jq
mkdir -p ~/tools && cd ~/tools
curl -L https://github.com/peass-ng/PEASS-ng/releases/latest/download/linpeas.sh -o linpeas.sh
curl -L https://github.com/peass-ng/PEASS-ng/releases/latest/download/winPEASx64.exe -o winPEASx64.exe
chmod +x linpeas.sh
```

**非 Kali 环境**

- Windows：`wsl --install -d kali-linux` 然后 `sudo apt install kali-linux-headless`
