EOF
ffuf -u "https://example.com/FUZZ" -w $RESULT_DIR/scan/403_bypass.txt -mc all -fc 404 -ac
```

**Header 伪装绕过**：

```bash
ffuf -u "https://example.com/admin" -H "X-Forwarded-For: FUZZ" -w <(printf '127.0.0.1\n0.0.0.0\n10.0.0.1\nlocalhost\n::1\n')
# 可替换的 Header：X-Forwarded-For / X-Real-IP / X-Originating-IP / X-Remote-IP
